>> title: Pumpkin Bread
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: pumpkin, spice, quick bread, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: pumpkin loaf
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 25 min

Grease a #9x5-in loaf pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Whisk @pumpkin purée{1%cup}(240 g; not pie filling), @granulated sugar{1%cup}(200 g), @vegetable oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @eggs{2%large}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(220 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g), @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}(3 g), @ground ginger{1/2%tsp}(1 g), @ground nutmeg{1/4%tsp}(0.5 g), @table salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Fold @&(~1)spiced flour{} into @&(3)pumpkin mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{65%min}.
